lady. While vultures are scavengers, often associated with greediness and death, they're actually very shy around people. These are birds that just, they don't like interacting with humans. The most common response if they are disturbed by humans is that they vomit and they fly away. And yet for centuries, a very specific symbiosis played out here in Mumbai, between these vultures, this forest, and the parses. Time passed, wars came and went,

