00:18:43.000 --> 00:19:22.000
came crashing to a halt. In the early 80s, Aspi noticed that there were fewer and fewer vultures sitting and waiting at their usual perch. Back then, we thought that it is a bird. Maybe it had moved somewhere else. Maybe their lifespan was short and they were towards the end of it. We could not understand why their population had decreased. Kandiyas all over India seem to be noticing this mysterious trend atop their respective

